request.description:
Checks if a book with the given title already exists in MongoDB. Used to prevent duplicate uploads.

Expected:
  200 OK — { exists: true/false }

Full-text search across a book's stored segments. Returns matching segments sorted by relevance. Powers the RAG (Retrieval-Augmented Generation) chat pipeline.

Expected:
  200 OK — { success: true, data: [ { content, pageNumber, ... } ] }

Registers a new book in MongoDB manually (without uploading a PDF). Used in the frontend upload flow after the PDF is stored in Vercel Blob.

Expected:
  201 Created — { success: true, data: { _id, title, slug, ... } }

